  "description": "ExcelConductor: The \"One Shot\" template-driven & model-driven Excel engine.\n\nEnd the misery of cell-by-cell manipulation. Bind and read complex Excel layouts - vertical, horizontal, multi-row, multi-column - without touching your code.\nStrict 1-based coordinates, RowSpan/ColSpan, culture-aware casting, and complete provider abstraction (ClosedXML/NPOI).\nDeveloped by Cyber Task Force (CTF Inc.)",
